(To start programming in Python, install a current Python 3 release from the official Python website. During installation on) Tj
T* (Windows, enable the option that adds Python to the system PATH if it is offered. Verify the installation from a terminal: - python) Tj
T* (--version On some systems, the command may be: - python3 --version If Python is installed correctly, the terminal displays the) Tj
T* (installed Python 3 version. Common development options include the Python interactive interpreter, Visual Studio Code,) Tj
T* (PyCharm, and other editors or IDEs.) Tj
