(The Python interpreter reads Python instructions and executes them. The interactive interpreter, often called the REPL) Tj
T* (\(Read-Evaluate-Print Loop\), lets you test small pieces of code immediately. A Python file normally uses the .py extension. For) Tj
T* (example, save a program as hello.py and run it from a terminal using: python hello.py) Tj
