(An update changes a variable by referencing its current value \(e.g., count = count + 1 increases count by 1\). Important: The) Tj
T* (variable must be initialized before its value can be read on the right-hand side of an assignment; otherwise, Python raises a) Tj
T* (NameError. Augmented Assignment: Python provides augmented assignment operators as a clean, idiomatic shorthand for) Tj
T* (updating variables in place:) Tj
