(7 to 12. The while Loop & Condition Control) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
42.5196850393700814 756.8506299212598378 Td
(A while loop evaluates its Boolean condition before each pass. If True, Python executes the indented body, then tests the) Tj
T* (condition again. The loop terminates as soon as the condition evaluates to False. The 3 Essential Parts of a while Loop: 1.) Tj
T* (Initialization: Set starting variable state before entering the loop. 2. Condition: Test the expression that governs whether another) Tj
T* (pass should run. 3. Update: Modify the loop variable inside the body to move toward the stopping condition. Counting Up and) Tj
T* (Down: Counters can increment \(count += 1\) or decrement \(countdown -= 1\) toward a boundary. Input-Controlled Loops &) Tj
T* (Sentinel Values: A while loop can repeatedly prompt the user until a specific sentinel value is entered \(e.g. entering 0 or 'quit'\).) Tj
T* (The sentinel value signals termination and should not be processed as normal data.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.004 0.2 0.137 rg
42.5196850393700814 662.1734645669290558 Td
(13 to 17. Infinite Loops, break, and continue) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
42.5196850393700814 648.0002362204724022 Td
(An infinite loop occurs when a loop condition never evaluates to False \(typically caused by a missing or flawed update step\). -) Tj
T* (Intentional Infinite Loops \(while True\): Often used in event listeners, menus, and servers. An intentional infinite loop requires a) Tj
T* (conditional break statement to ensure an exit path. - The break Statement: Immediately terminates the nearest enclosing for or) Tj
T* (while loop and jumps to the first statement following the loop. - The continue Statement: Immediately skips the remaining) Tj
T* (statements in the current iteration and jumps directly to the next iteration's condition or item. - Caution in while Loops: Ensure the) Tj
T* (loop counter is updated BEFORE continue, otherwise the loop will repeat the same state infinitely!) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.004 0.2 0.137 rg
42.5196850393700814 565.2285826771652637 Td
(18 to 23. The for Loop & The range\(\) Function) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
