T* (Splitting Pattern: with open\('students.csv', 'r', encoding='utf-8'\) as f: header = f.readline\(\).rstrip\(\).split\(','\) for line in f: row =) Tj
T* (line.rstrip\(\).split\(','\) name, score, city = row[0], float\(row[1]\), row[2] Standard Library csv Module: When data fields contain) Tj
