T* (quacks like a duck, it is a duck.' As long as an object implements the expected method, Python executes it without requiring rigid) Tj
T* (interface hierarchies: def announce_speaker\(entity\): print\(entity.speak\(\)\) # Works for Dog, Cat, Person, or Robot!) Tj
