T* (sends an exact ASCII byte stream: GET /code3/romeo.txt HTTP/1.1 Host: data.pr4e.org User-Agent: Python-Urllib/3.10) Tj
T* (Connection: close Key Rules of an HTTP Request: 1. Method Line: GET <path> HTTP/1.1 followed by . 2. Headers: Key: Value) Tj
T* (pairs providing metadata \(Host header is mandatory in HTTP 1.1\). 3. The Blank Line \( \): Signals the end of the request headers!) Tj
T* (The Server Response Format: HTTP/1.1 200 OK Content-Type: text/plain Content-Length: 167 [Response Payload Body]) Tj
