T* (URLs like Local Disk Files: import urllib.request with urllib.request.urlopen\('http://data.pr4e.org/romeo.txt'\) as response: for line in) Tj
T* (response: # Each line arrives as bytes; decode to Unicode clean_line = line.decode\('utf-8'\).rstrip\(\) print\(clean_line\) Key) Tj
T* (Advantages of urllib: - Automatically handles HTTP 1.1 Host headers and connection lifecycle. - Supports streaming iterators:) Tj
T* (processes multi-gigabyte downloads with O\(1\) RAM. - Transparently integrates with authentication, proxies, and cookies.) Tj
