(Web Scraping is the automated extraction of data from website HTML. Because scrapers can overload servers if unchecked,) Tj
T* (professional developers adhere to strict ethical guidelines: 1. Inspect robots.txt: Every responsible website publishes crawling) Tj
T* (permissions at https://example.com/robots.txt: User-agent: * Disallow: /admin/ Disallow: /api/private/ Crawl-delay: 5 2. Respect) Tj
T* (Rate Limits: Never hammer a server with hundreds of requests per second. Always insert intentional delays using) Tj
T* (time.sleep\(1.0\) between page fetches. 3. Provide an Identifiable User-Agent: Identify your bot honestly with contact information) Tj
T* (in the User-Agent header so webmasters can reach you if your script causes issues. 4. Check for Official APIs First: If a website) Tj
T* (provides a public REST API \(e.g. GitHub, Weather services\), always consume the structured API rather than scraping raw) Tj
T* (HTML.) Tj
