(Production applications must anticipate external API failures: - Rate Limits \(HTTP 429\): Respect Retry-After headers and apply) Tj
T* (exponential backoff. - Network Timeouts: Always specify explicit timeout limits \(e.g. timeout=10\) on urlopen\(\) calls to prevent) Tj
T* (worker threads from freezing indefinitely. - Schema Drift: Use dict.get\(key, default\) when accessing response dictionaries to) Tj
T* (prevent KeyError if the API provider removes or renames an optional field.) Tj
