(Relational database modeling, SQLite integration with sqlite3, SQL queries, parameterized statements) Tj
T* (preventing SQL injection, multi-table JOINs, many-to-many junction tables, and exporting data for interactive) Tj
T* (web visualization.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0. 0.529 0.353 rg
42.5196850393700814 654.5199212598424765 Td
(1. Introduction) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
42.5196850393700814 637.5120472440944468 Td
(Throughout the previous fourteen modules of this boot camp, we have progressed from basic syntax, variables, and loops to) Tj
T* (object-oriented programming, regular expressions, and networked web services. Yet every application we have built faced a) Tj
T* (fundamental data storage limitation: flat text files and JSON documents are linear. As dataset sizes grow to hundreds of) Tj
T* (thousands or millions of records, searching a flat file requires scanning every byte sequentially \($O\(N\)$ linear time\), and) Tj
T* (updating a single record requires rewriting the entire file to disk. Relational Database Management Systems \(RDBMS\) solve) Tj
T* (these performance and scalability limits. Databases store structured tables indexed with balanced B-trees, enabling instant) Tj
T* ($O\(log N\)$ lookups across billions of rows. Furthermore, databases enforce ACID guarantees \(Atomicity, Consistency, Isolation,) Tj
T* (Durability\), ensuring that financial transactions and multi-user updates never leave data partially written or corrupted. Based on) Tj
T* (Chapters 15 and 16 of Dr. Charles Severance's 'Python for Everybody', this capstone module unites every skill acquired in this) Tj
T* (boot camp into a complete, enterprise-grade data engineering pipeline. You will master Python's built-in sqlite3 engine: modeling) Tj
T* (normalized relational schemas \(1-to-many and many-to-many relationships\), executing parameterized SQL queries to eliminate) Tj
T* (SQL injection vulnerabilities, joining tables across Primary and Foreign Keys, managing transaction rollbacks and commits, and) Tj
T* (building the complete Capstone Project: an automated pipeline that ingests data from external sources, structures it inside) Tj
T* (SQLite, and exports it for high-impact interactive web visualization.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0. 0.529 0.353 rg
42.5196850393700814 453.8270078740156919 Td
