(1. Why Relational Databases? ACID Guarantees vs. Flat Files) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
42.5196850393700814 244.0632283464568673 Td
(Consider building an e-commerce platform that processes 100 orders per second: Why Flat Files Fail: 1. Concurrency) Tj
T* (Bottlenecks: If two users write to orders.csv simultaneously, file write collisions corrupt the file. 2. Slow Query Performance:) Tj
T* (Searching a 10GB CSV file for customer 'Rahul Kumar' requires reading all 10GB from disk \(O\(N\) full table scan\). 3. No) Tj
T* (Transactional Safety: If power fails while writing an invoice, the file is half-written and unusable. The Relational Database) Tj
T* (Solution \(ACID Properties\): - Atomicity: An entire transaction succeeds, or it is completely rolled back \(all-or-nothing\). -) Tj
T* (Consistency: Enforces schema data types and foreign key constraints; invalid data cannot be saved. - Isolation: Concurrent) Tj
T* (transactions execute independently without interfering with each other. - Durability: Once a transaction is committed, data is) Tj
T* (permanently recorded on physical storage even if the server immediately crashes.) Tj
ET
BT
/F2 11 Tf
12.6499999999999986 TL
0.004 0.2 0.137 rg
42.5196850393700814 137.4805511811025553 Td
(2. The SQLite Architecture: Python's Embedded Engine) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 9 Tf
10.3499999999999996 TL
0.2 0.255 0.333 rg
42.5196850393700814 123.3073228346459018 Td
(Unlike enterprise client-server databases \(such as PostgreSQL, MySQL, or Oracle\) which require separate server daemons, port) Tj
T* (configurations, and user permission setups: SQLite is Serverless and Embedded: - The entire database engine is compiled) Tj
T* (directly into Python via the sqlite3 C library. - The entire database - including tables, indexes, schemas, and millions of rows -) Tj
T* (lives inside a single cross-platform disk file \(e.g. bootcamp.sqlite\). - Zero configuration: You can create, populate, and query a) Tj
T* (database in three lines of Python without installing external database software.) Tj
ET
endstream
